{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015f1qsaen3NLQvnR5HvFhD8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 30\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 主目标调整为 EMNLP 2026 ARR (5/25), AAAI 2027 为后备\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指出 EMNLP ARR 5/25 时间不紧、不要保守、资源会给够。12 天 AI 团队速度足够：Phase 0 (1-2天) →\\\\n    Phase 1 compiler (2-3天) → Phase 2 experiments (2-3天) → Paper (2-3天)。禁止 fallback\\\\n    思维，冲最高目标。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: SciERC Phase 0 结果确认 GO — domain_range violation rate 15.4%，3× 超阈值\\\\n  rationale: 'SciERC 全量 test set (551 sentences, 1724 triples): domain_range_violation_rate\\\\n    = 15.4%，远超 5% go/no-go 阈值。违规分布极不均匀 (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4% vs Used-for\\\\n    0.76%)，支持\\\\\\\"特定 relation types 需要 decoding-time enforcement\\\\\\\"的论文 claim。DocRED dry-run\\\\n    (37 docs) 同样显示 14.4%。两个数据集均为 GO 信号，MVP 核心假设得到强验证。等 schema-informed prompt 结果确认\\\\n    prompt 级干预不足以解决问题后正式宣布 MVP 通过。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: domain_range_violation_rate=15.4%, go_nogo=GO\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段，立即启动 Phase 2 constrained decoding 实验\\\\n  rationale: Phase 0 三个实验完成：SciERC 15.4%/5.78%, DocRED 18.7% domain_range violation\\\\n    rate。两个数据集均远超 5% 阈值，核心假设得到强验证。Phase 1 compiler 代码就绪（36 tests 通过），Phase 2 脚本就绪（S1\\\\n    路径可用，S2 bug 修复中）。cuda:1 空闲，立即启动 Phase 2 SciERC grammar_only/semantic_only/full_s1\\\\n    实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SciERC DR=15.4%, GO\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_scierc_schema\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SciERC DR=5.78%, prompt insufficient\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DocRED DR=18.7%, GO\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：grammar+semantic (full_s1) DR↓94% F1 neutral，两层约束协同效应成立\\\\n  rationale: _v2 干净数据 551 样本全量结果：full_s1 DR=0.93%（baseline 15.37%，↓94%），R-F1 微升 +0.0013。grammar\\\\n    单独消除 RV/ET，semantic 单独降 DR 24%，组合后 94%——超加性效应。论文核心 claim 站住。早期污染数据 semantic_only\\\\n    DR=16.43% 已修正为 11.65%。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV/ET=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, F1=0.0836\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR↓94% F1无损，CF violation↑124x 作为已知 tradeoff\\\\n    待 S2 对比后决定处理策略\\\\n  rationale: v2 干净数据 551/551 全量验证，Reviewer PASS。Grammar+Semantic 协同效应成立，ablation story\\\\n    清晰。CF violation（0.08%→9.9%）是约束副作用，需等 S2 结果判断是在论文中作为 limitation 还是加 CF 约束修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%, RV=1.39%, ET=0.4%, RF1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV=0%, ET=0%, RF1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%, RV=1.51%, ET=0.4%, RF1=0.0815\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, RV=0%, ET=0%, RF1=0.0836, CF=9.9%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR -94% 且 F1 无损，CF violation 上升为已知 limitation\\\\n  rationale: v2 干净数据全量（551/551）结果经 Reviewer PASS 验证：Full S1 DR 15.37%→0.93%（↓94%），R-F1\\\\n    +0.13pp，ET/RV→0%。Ablation story 清晰（grammar 管格式、semantic 管语义、双层协同）。CF violation\\\\n    从 0.08%→9.9% 是已知副作用，需在论文中正面报告并论述与 DR 的性质差异。Semantic-only DR=11.65% 说明两层是 multiplicative\\\\n    关系。决定推进 DocRED Phase 2 跨数据集验证 + 等 S2 对比。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%, R-F1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV/ET=0%, F1持平\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%, F1-0.08pp\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, R-F1=0.0836(+0.13pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_docred_schema\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: DocRED DR=12.8%(-32%), 验证prompt级不足\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: S2 降级为架构 ablation，S1 为主推策略；标题去掉 \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 改 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: S2 全量结果(551/551)确认：DR 0.97%(vs S1 0.93%)、CF 8.03%(vs S1 9.9%，降幅不显著)、R-F1\\\\n    8.03%(vs S1 8.36%)。S2 在所有指标上均未优于 S1，两通道分离未能解决 CF 问题。CF 是 per-relation 独立 type\\\\n    enforcement 的固有限制，非架构可解。S2 定位从\\\\\\\"CF 解决方案\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"架构灵活性展示\\\\\\\"，论文中放 ablation/appendix。标题\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 与 0.93% 残余不符，改为 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.97%, CF=8.03%, R-F1=8.03% — no advantage over S1\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, CF=9.9%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 补跑 DocRED semantic_only 完成跨数据集全消融；论文写作提前至 DocRED 分析完成后立即启动\\\\n  rationale: 'SciERC 有 5 路消融但 DocRED 只有 grammar_only + full_s1，缺 semantic_only。Claim\\\\n    3 (enabling dependency) 在 DocRED 上的证据链不完整——审稿人必问\\\\\\\"为何 DocRED 不做 semantic_only 对比\\\\\\\"。DocRED\\\\n    约束更紧(avg 5.68 valid pairs)，semantic_only 预期效果更差，反而是 enabling dependency 的更强证据。论文写作从\\\\n    5/19 提前到 DocRED 分析完成后(~5/16)，DocRED semantic_only 与写作并行，结果 patch 进去。grammar-semantic\\\\n    交互 bug (invariant: semantic mask ⊆ grammar allowed set) 需写入 Method section 作为\\\\n    resolution protocol。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_grammar_only\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: DR↓24% but ET/RV not eliminated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: Llama-3.1-8B cross-model 验证升级为 should-have，SciERC-only (unconstrained +\\\\n    full_s1)\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 实测 DocRED 实验进度远超预期（May 15 早间全部完成 vs 原估 May 17-18），多出 2-3 天 buffer。单模型是最可能的\\\\n    EMNLP reviewer 批评 (C5)，2 组 SciERC 实验 4-6 GPU 小时即可完成，风险可控。constraint compiler 声称\\\\n    model-agnostic，跨模型验证是最直接的证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR↓94% F1无损\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR 15.37%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 三档 Weak Reject (3/6) → 制定 6 项结构性补强计划：post-hoc baseline + bootstrap\\\\n    CI + related work 20+ + PICARD 对比 + CF/F1 Discussion 段\\\\n  rationale: Dream 模拟三档一致指出 6 个结构性缺陷：(1) 单模型泛化弱 → Llama cross-model 已在跑，(2) 无 post-hoc\\\\n    filtering baseline → 必须加，(3) related work 仅 7 引用 → 扩到 20+，(4) 无统计显著性 → bootstrap\\\\n    CI，(5) CF trade-off 无下游验证 → 加强论证，(6) 低 F1 实用性 → Discussion 段。Dream 基于缺少 Llama\\\\n    数据 + 有 bug 的 violation 数字，实际情况好于模拟。补强后预期从 3/6 提升到 4-5/6 区间。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 推翻之前 ET 计数口径决定——修正 ET triple-counting，每个 entity 只计 1 次 ET violation（不在\\\\n    entity_list + head + tail 各计一次）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查指出：(1) ET=8.18% 被 inflate 至多 3× (实际 ~2.47%)，是不必要的攻击面；(2) grammar/full_s1\\\\n    ET=0% 不受影响；(3) 相对对比仍有效；(4) 距 May 19 DDL 仍有修正窗口。之前\\\\\\\"保持一致性\\\\\\\"的理由成立但 Reviewer 认为论文可信度\\\\n    > 方法学惰性。修正后所有非零 ET 数字将变小，但 constrained decoding 的 ET→0% 仍然成立，paper story 更干净。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: ET 8.18%→~2.47%\\\\n    result: 需重算\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ET 10.44%→~3.5%\\\\n    result: 需重算\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Bootstrap CI framing: 选 (B) 逐数据集报告 F1 significance，DocRED +0.50pp p<0.001，SciERC\\\\n    neutral p=0.58'\\\\n  rationale: Bootstrap CI (10000×) 揭示 DocRED F1 提升统计显著，机制为 grammar 消除 OOV relation\\\\n    names (RV 29.66%→0.03%) 减少 FP。SciERC RV 仅 1.39% 故效果不显著。选逐数据集报告而非统一 framing，最诚实且不升级为\\\\n    core claim。更新 paper_framing.md 中 C6/C8 相关表述。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 +0.50pp vs unconstrained, p<0.001\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 +0.13pp vs unconstrained, p=0.58 (non-significant)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Post-hoc baseline framing: 不以 F1 论高低，多维对比 (recall + coverage + operational)，诚实承认\\\\n    precision trade-off'\\\\n  rationale: Post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24），因\\\\n    low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。但 post-hoc recall 下降（SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED\\\\n    -1.06pp），DocRED 丢弃 48.1% triples。OntoCoDec recall 上升（+0.20/+0.56pp）= 概率质量重分配生效。Framing\\\\n    重心放在 recall preservation + information coverage + streaming compatibility，诚实承认\\\\n    precision trade-off。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.23\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.36, recall 11.60\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1 7.74\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.24, recall 10.02\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: Tightness scaling claim 修订：从单因素(tightness)改为双因素(tightness × model RV baseline)。Llama\\\\n    DocRED DR↓90.2% 打破原 \\\\\\\"scales inversely with tightness\\\\\\\" claim。\\\\n  rationale: Llama DocRED full_s1 DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%) vs Qwen 18.46%→10.21% (↓44.7%)。同一\\\\n    ontology (τ̄=0.842) 下差距巨大。原因：Qwen RV=29.66% 远高于 Llama RV=16.03%，grammar 层将 OOV\\\\n    triples 强制匹配有效关系名后揭露大量 latent DR violations。修订为\\\\\\\"tightness 与 model RV baseline\\\\n    共同决定 enforcement ceiling\\\\\\\"。这实际强化论文——揭示 model-constraint 交互效应。同时 E-F1 claim 需限定为\\\\n    Qwen-specific（Llama E-F1 -0.64pp）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR 26.07→2.55 (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp, E-F1 -0.64pp, CF 12.02%\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR 26.07%, RV 16.03%, R-F1 5.98%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: DR 10.21% (↓44.7%), Qwen RV baseline 29.66%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D015: Dream #2 结果处理 — Title 去掉 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"，6 项 action items 按优先级处理'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #2 三档 worst=2.5/median=3.0/best=3.0，比 Dream #1 (全 3/6) 改善。三档共识：(1)\\\\n    Title \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\" overclaim (DocRED 10.21% residual)，(2) CF severity 无 downstream\\\\n    验证，(3) 技术新颖性质疑。Title 修订为去掉 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"——论文贡献是方法（compiled ontology constraints），不是特定消除率；结果从\\\\n    0.93% 到 10.21% 变异太大不适合 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"。CF downstream 验证需架构修改，5天内不可行，保持在 limitations。技术新颖性通过\\\\n    §6 positioning 强化 IE-specific 贡献（stateful entity registry, prefix-decidable constraints）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260514T205155\\\\n    role: dream\\\\n    result: worst=2.5, median=3.0, best=3.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Llama bootstrap CI 修复完成，全部 p-values 写入论文，framing 从 \\\\\\\"F1-neutral\\\\\\\"\\\\n    升级为 \\\\\\\"both models significant R-F1 gains on DocRED\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: v2 bootstrap 脚本修复了两个 bug（int entity crash + entity type normalization），8\\\\n    项 point estimate 全部 registry-aligned (≤0.05pp)。结果：Llama DocRED R-F1 +0.29pp p=0.013（显著正向），E-F1\\\\n    -0.64pp p=0.022（显著负向）。这使得 DocRED 上两个模型 R-F1 都显著提升，是比 \\\\\\\"F1-neutral\\\\\\\" 更强的 claim。E-F1\\\\n    模型依赖性如实报告。已更新 crossmodel §5、abstract、conclusion。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1=2.68, E-F1=23.56\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n    result: R-F1=2.54 (-0.14pp p=0.011), E-F1=23.49 (NS)\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1=5.98, E-F1=55.65\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n    result: R-F1=6.27 (+0.29pp p=0.013), E-F1=55.01 (-0.64pp p=0.022)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: 批准 pair-based σ(r) enforcement 升级，与 W1 CF fallback 合并实现。SciERC DR\\\\n    0.93%→0% 可期，DocRED DR 再降 ~28%'\\\\n  rationale: Rectangularity 分析显示 SciERC 0/7、DocRED 73/96 relations 非矩形。当前 independent\\\\n    enforcement (head∈dom ∧ tail∈range) 是 pair-based σ(r) 的松弛近似，SciERC 全部 16 个残余 DR\\\\n    violations 属于 over-permissive gap。实现 pair-based 改动量小（set membership → tuple lookup），可与\\\\n    CF fallback 代码合并，无额外 GPU 开销。收益：SciERC DR=0% 是 complete elimination claim，显著强于\\\\n    near-complete。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 16 residual DR all from over-permissive gap\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 491/1770 DR (27.7%) from over-permissive gap\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: running, validates CF mechanism\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D018: 批准 W5 LoRA fine-tune 实验（Qwen3-8B on SciERC），条件启动——先验 baseline DR\\\\n    再决定跑 constrained'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 分析指出 W5 是从 Weak Reject → Accept 的最大杠杆（预估 +0.5 分）。LoRA fine-tune\\\\n    Qwen3-8B on SciERC 是最受控实验（同模型同数据只加 fine-tuning 变量），~6 GPU-hrs，可与 W1 CF fallback\\\\n    并行。风险控制：先跑 unconstrained fine-tuned baseline 检查 DR 率，若 DR<2% 则边际收益不显著需重新评估。10\\\\n    天 DDL 内时间充裕。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.21%, R-F1=8.23%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D018: 修正 D017 — 代码已是 pair-based，取消代码改动，改为纯写作修复 + 残余 DR 根因调查。批准 W5 LoRA\\\\n    fine-tune 实验（~6 GPU-hrs）'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 独立核实 type_mask_processor.py:360 调用 valid_tail_types_for_head(head_type)，combined\\\\n    enforcement 等价于 full pair-based。§3 Eq.(2) 和 line 106-107 描述错误（写了 independent dom/range），W2\\\\n    标注 resolved 不正确。D017 的代码改动取消，转为：(1) §3 formalization 与代码对齐（σ-notation）(2) 调查 SciERC\\\\n    16 个残余 DR 的真实原因（代码已 pair-based 却仍有 violations）(3) rectangularity 量化数据作为新 finding\\\\n    写入论文。同时批准 W5 LoRA fine-tune SciERC 实验（~6 GPU-hrs），staged approach: 先跑 unconstrained\\\\n    fine-tuned baseline 检查 DR，>5% 再跑 constrained。这是从 Weak Reject 到 Accept 的最大杠杆。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 16 residual DR despite pair-based code — cause unknown\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: ongoing\\\\n    result: running, validates CF mechanism\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D020: W1 CF fallback 定为 analytical finding（方案 A 变体），取消剩余 3 个 CF 实验，GPU\\\\n    全转 W5'\\\\n  rationale: CF fallback pilot 结果明确：CF 9.90%→0.04% 但 DR 0.93%→14.78%，总违规预算反增 3.99pp。本质是约束优先级\\\\n    re-routing 而非 reduction。无需跨模型/数据集确认——机制层面已解释清楚（registry 一致性 vs DR enforcement\\\\n    的基本张力）。加上之前 CF 63.3% 来自 Generic↔OST schema 歧义的分析，W1 回应转为：\\\\\\\"CF↔DR 根本性张力 + 当前系统近最优\\\\n    + CF 主要来自 schema 歧义\\\\\\\"。这比\\\\\\\"我们消除了 CF\\\\\\\"更诚实也更有深度。取消 3 个 CF 实验释放 ~12 GPU-hrs，全部投入更高 impact\\\\n    的 W5 LoRA（+0.5 分 vs +0.3 分）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CF 0.04% but DR 14.78%, total +3.99pp, NEGATIVE\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: CF 9.90%, DR 0.93%, total 10.83%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: 保留 w1_cf_fallback_docred 实验（修正 D020），取消仅限 2 个 Llama CF 实验'\\\\n  rationale: D020 说取消 3 个 CF 实验，但 docred CF 已在 D020 后 4min 被提交到 cuda:1。当前不阻塞 W5（W5\\\\n    eval 在 cuda:0）。DocRED τ̄=0.842（远高于 SciERC 0.333），跨数据集验证 CF↔DR trade-off 有独立价值——特别是\\\\n    tightness→fallback rate 的 6× 相关性。Python 进程已加载代码到内存，磁盘上回退 CF fallback 代码不影响运行中的\\\\n    DocRED 实验。保留 docred，仅取消 llama_scierc 和 llama_docred。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_docred\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: RUNNING cuda:1, 9% progress\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: NEGATIVE, DR 14.78%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D022: W5 gate DR=1.95%≈2%, 仍跑 constrained eval 收集完整 2×2 矩阵（base/FT × unconstrained/constrained）'\\\\n  rationale: 1) 1.95% vs 2% 差异在噪声范围内，不应以硬阈值卡掉有价值的数据；2) 完整 2×2 对比表是论文 composability\\\\n    story 的核心证据——fine-tuning 内化常见约束，OntoCoDec 消除剩余 schema-ambiguous 违规（Evaluate-for\\\\n    13.1%），两者互补；3) 成本极低（~30min 1×GPU）；4) 无数据的 claim 不如有数据的 nuanced claim\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval\\\\n    role: gate_check\\\\n    result: DR=1.95%, R-F1=43.9%, E-F1=67.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_training\\\\n    role: prerequisite\\\\n    result: success, loss=0.0586, acc=98.16%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reframe Claim 3 (composability): 从 \\\\\\\"fine-tuning 后仍有高 DR\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"fine-tuning\\\\n    消除大部分违规，tight-constraint 关系是 learning-resistant 长尾，约束解码精确覆盖此尾部\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: W5 unconstrained eval 聚合 DR=1.95% 以 0.05pp 之差未过 2% 阈值，但按关系类型拆分后 Evaluate-for\\\\n    DR=13.13%（tightness=0.361，仅 23 个合法 pair），而宽松关系（Used-for 0.16%、Hyponym-of 0%）几乎被\\\\n    fine-tuning 消灭。新叙事更精确、更可辩护：约束解码的价值不是全局覆盖，而是精确靶向 learning 难以覆盖的 tight-constraint\\\\n    长尾。这比原来的\\\\\\\"一刀切需要约束\\\\\\\"论点更强。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: DR=1.95% aggregate, Evaluate-for 13.13%, fine-tuning +36pp E-F1 +35pp\\\\n      R-F1\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: W5 composability 确认 — Fine-tuned + OntoCoDec 实现 DR=0.0%，R-F1 仅损\\\\n    0.09pp，CF 从 9.90pp 降至 1.18pp。2×2 矩阵是 Claim 3 最强证据。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #11 PASS。2×2 矩阵清晰证明 fine-tuning 和 OntoCoDec 互补而非冗余：fine-tuning\\\\n    负责质量(F1+35pp)，OntoCoDec 负责合规保障(DR→0%)。Tight-constraint 关系(Evaluate-for 13.13%→0%)是\\\\n    OntoCoDec 的独特价值——fine-tuning 无法学会紧约束。CF 残余 1.18% 源于 schema 歧义(Generic↔X)，非系统缺陷，放\\\\n    limitations。目标分数从 2.75 升至 3.75-4.0。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_constrained_eval\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.0%, CF=1.18%, R-F1=43.77%, composability confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=1.95%, CF=0%, R-F1=43.86%\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_training\\\\n    role: prerequisite\\\\n    result: LoRA adapter trained successfully\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: zero-shot DR=0.93%, CF=9.90%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: W5 composability 确认——Fine-tuned + OntoCoDec 实现 DR=0.0%，R-F1 仅损 0.09pp，CF\\\\n    从 9.90pp 降至 1.18pp。2×2 矩阵是论文最强证据。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #11 独立核实 551/551 样本完整，violation_report 与 registry 交叉验证一致。2×2\\\\n    矩阵三个核心洞察：(1) composability 成立——FT 负责质量(+35pp F1)，OntoCoDec 负责合规(DR 0%)；(2) CF\\\\n    干扰随 FT 降低 88%（9.82pp→1.18pp）；(3) tight-constraint 关系（如 Evaluate-for τ=0.361）是\\\\n    OntoCoDec 独特价值——FT 后仍有 13.13% DR，OntoCoDec 降至 0%。目标分数从 2.75 提升至 3.75-4.0 (Accept)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_constrained_eval\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.0%, CF=1.18%, R-F1=43.77%, R-F1 delta=-0.09pp\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=1.95%, CF=0%, R-F1=43.86%\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_lora_scierc_training\\\\n    role: prerequisite\\\\n    result: LoRA fine-tune success\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: zero-shot comparison\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, CF=9.90%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D026: 确认 w1_cf_fallback_docred 代码不含 CF fallback 逻辑（Reviewer 第三次核实），要求\\\\n    Agent 停止并修正'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 在 review #10, #12, #13 三次独立确认：cuda:1 上运行的 w1_cf_fallback_docred\\\\n    实际是普通 full_s1 配置，grep 无 cf_fallback 相关代码。继续运行只会产出与 phase2_docred_full_s1 重复的结果。要求\\\\n    Agent 立即验证并修正——实现真正 CF fallback 代码后重跑，或改为 D020 analytical finding 的 DocRED 延伸分析。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_docred\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: code mismatch confirmed 3x\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: D020 analytical finding\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D026: 杀掉 w1_cf_fallback_docred（实际跑普通 full_s1，CF fallback 代码已回退），W1 转为\\\\n    analytical resolution + W5 FT 证据'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #12 确认 CF fallback 代码 grep 0 匹配，w1_cf_fallback_docred 实际运行\\\\n    plain full_s1，与已完成的 phase2_docred_full_s1 重复。W1 的实质回应已由 D020 analytical finding（CF↔DR\\\\n    根本性张力）+ W5 FT+OntoCoDec（CF 降 88%）充分覆盖。释放 cuda:1 用于 Llama SciERC eval 和潜在的 DocRED\\\\n    LoRA。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_docred\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: redundant plain full_s1, CF fallback code reverted\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: existing_equivalent\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot\\\\n    role: analytical_basis\\\\n    result: D020 analytical finding\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D028: Llama SciERC 2×2 composability 确认——FT+OntoCoDec DR=0.09%, R-F1 +0.02pp，跨模型一致性成立'\\\\n  rationale: 'Llama FT+OntoCoDec: DR 从 1.11%→0.09%（-91.9%），R-F1 45.47%（+0.02pp 零代价）。与\\\\n    Qwen FT+OntoCoDec（DR=0.0%, R-F1 -0.09pp）高度一致，跨模型 composability claim 成立。论文 Table\\\\n    3/5 和 §5.4/5.5 已更新。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_llama_lora_scierc_constrained_eval\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.09%, R-F1=45.47%, E-F1=67.76%\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_llama_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=1.11%, R-F1=45.45%, E-F1=67.76%\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_llama_lora_scierc_training\\\\n    role: prerequisite\\\\n    result: token_acc=98.17%, 654s\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill all DocRED training processes and resubmit with CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\n    fix\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: spec.command内层CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0硬编码覆盖wrapper注入值，导致Qwen跑在GPU\\\\n    0而非GPU 1；僵尸进程未清理占56 GiB致Llama OOM。全部kill后修复硬编码bug重新提交。Qwen才跑9%，重跑成本低于保留错误状态的风险。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_llama_docred_lora_training\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: OOM crashed due to GPU 0 memory exhaustion\\\\n  - exp_id: w5_qwen_docred_lora_training\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: Running on wrong GPU (0 instead of 1), zombie process from retry not cleaned\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 22045, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HtRXuiYSA4cqSMkc9Ax1p4","session_id":"a8f7b9b0-e3ba-485f-a37e-4e472b218b82","uuid":"4dea8b2a-deb7-4dc5-ae6b-973a9869ab51","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:52:16.316Z"}
