l 对比计算 composability delta ← 基于 w5_qwen_docred_lora_training\\n- **w5_llama_docred_lora_unconstrained_eval** (success): Fine-tuned Llama-3.1-8B DocRED LoRA unconstrained eval — 获取 fine-tuned baseline DR/R-F1，与 constrained eval 对比计算 composability delta ← 基于 w5_llama_docred_lora_training\\n- **w5_qwen_docred_lora_training** (success): Qwen3-8B LoRA fine-tune on DocRED — 填补 Qwen DocRED composability 2×2 matrix 的 FT 行。预期：(1) LoRA 后 E-F1/R-F1 大幅提升；(2) 残余 DR > 0% 证明 OntoCoDec 在 DocRED FT 上仍有 composability 价值。\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 32 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 35\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w1_cf_fallback_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011JtavGK3Vw1qHMRn8LoSAf","session_id":"a8f7b9b0-e3ba-485f-a37e-4e472b218b82","uuid":"f590e002-ce3f-435e-bbce-c8fa54cf1c25","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:52:35.307Z"}
