{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BfHYsdPc21bAx6a5z9KhGP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema_semantic_constrained_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 18:13 UTC | 更新原因: D028: Llama SciERC 2×2 完成 + DocRED LoRA 双卡并行训练中\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nOntoCoDec: 两层约束解码（grammar + semantic）自动编译 IE ontology schema 为 token-level constraints，消除 LLM-based IE 的 ontology constraint violations。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n**阶段**: Round 1 审稿应对 — composability matrix 扩展中\\\\n- **Qwen SciERC 2×2**: ✅ DR=0.0%, R-F1 -0.09pp\\\\n- **Llama SciERC 2×2**: ✅ DR=0.09%, R-F1 +0.02pp (D028)\\\\n- **跨模型一致性确认**: Claim 3 composability 两模型坚实支撑\\\\n- **Issue Tracker**: 15/16 resolved + W1 in_progress (analytical finding + Paper Agent 写作中)\\\\n- **论文**: Table 3/5, §5.4/5.5, Appendix B 已更新，PDF 编译通过\\\\n\\\\n## Composability 覆盖进展\\\\n| | SciERC | DocRED |\\\\n|--|--------|--------|\\\\n| Qwen3-8B | ✅ 完整 2×2 | 🔥 LoRA 训练中 (cuda:1, ETA ~2h) |\\\\n| Llama3.1-8B | ✅ 完整 2×2 (D028) | ⏳ SFT 数据生成中 → cuda:0 训练 |\\\\n\\\\n## 2×2 Composability Matrices\\\\n\\\\n### Qwen3-8B × SciERC\\\\n| | Unconstrained | Constrained | ΔDR | ΔR-F1 |\\\\n|--|--|--|--|--|\\\\n| Zero-shot | DR=15.37%, R-F1=8.23% | DR=0.93%, R-F1=8.36% | -94% | +0.13pp |\\\\n| Fine-tuned LoRA | DR=1.95%, R-F1=43.86% | DR=0.0%, R-F1=43.77% | -100% | -0.09pp |\\\\n\\\\n### Llama3.1-8B × SciERC\\\\n| | Unconstrained | Constrained | ΔDR | ΔR-F1 |\\\\n|--|--|--|--|--|\\\\n| Zero-shot | DR=13.34%, R-F1=2.68% | DR=0.08%, R-F1=2.54% | -99.4% | -0.14pp |\\\\n| Fine-tuned LoRA | DR=1.11%, R-F1=45.45% | DR=0.09%, R-F1=45.47% | -91.9% | +0.02pp |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键路径\\\\n1. ~~Llama SciERC 2×2~~ ✅ (D028)\\\\n2. **Qwen DocRED LoRA** ← cuda:1 训练中 (~2h)\\\\n3. **Llama DocRED LoRA** ← cuda:0 准备中（SFT 数据 + 脚本适配）\\\\n4. 各自跑 unconstrained + constrained eval → 完整 4 格 matrix\\\\n5. 全文数字一致性审查 → Round 2 review\\\\n6. May 19 内部稿交付 → May 25 EMNLP ARR 提交\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 调度\\\\nwestd-16980: cuda:0 + cuda:1\\\\n- cuda:0: ⏳ Llama DocRED LoRA 待提交（SFT 数据生成中）\\\\n- cuda:1: 🔥 Qwen DocRED LoRA 训练中 (PID 295334)\\\\n\\\\n## 关键数字速查\\\\n| 指标 | Qwen SciERC | Qwen DocRED | Llama SciERC | Llama DocRED |\\\\n|------|-------------|-------------|--------------|--------------|\\\\n| DR reduction (ZS) | 94% | 45% | 99.4% | 90.2% |\\\\n| R-F1 delta (ZS) | +0.13pp | +0.50pp*** | -0.14pp | +0.29pp* |\\\\n| **FT+OntoCoDec DR** | **0.0%** | **TBD** | **0.09%** | **TBD** |\\\\n| **FT+OntoCoDec ΔF1** | **-0.09pp** | **TBD** | **+0.02pp** | **TBD** |\\\\n\\\\n## CF Fallback Ablation（D020 analytical finding）\\\\n| 指标 | full_s1 baseline | CF fallback | Delta |\\\\n|------|-----------------|-------------|-------|\\\\n| CF | 9.90% | 0.04% | -9.86pp |\\\\n| DR | 0.93% | 14.78% | +13.85pp |\\\\n| Total | 10.83% | 14.82% | +3.99pp |\\\\n结论：CF↔DR 根本性张力，当前系统近最优。63.3% CF 来自 schema 歧义。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标分数路径\\\\n- ~~Weak Reject 2.75/5~~\\\\n- ~~W1+W2 写作修复: 3.5/5~~\\\\n- ~~W5 LoRA 成功: 3.75-4.0/5~~\\\\n- **Llama LoRA 成功: 4.0/5+ (强 Accept)** ← 当前\\\\n- DocRED LoRA 全补完: 4.25/5 (very strong)\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-15 | Kill all DocRED training processes and resubmit wi | w5_llama_docred_lora_training, w5_qwen_docred_lora_training |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-15 | D028: Llama SciERC 2×2 composability 确认——FT+OntoCo | w5_llama_lora_scierc_constrained_eval, w5_llama_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval, w5_llama_lora_scierc_training |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | D026: 杀掉 w1_cf_fallback_docred（实际跑普通 full_s1，CF fa | w1_cf_fallback_docred, phase2_docred_full_s1, w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | D026: 确认 w1_cf_fallback_docred 代码不含 CF fallback 逻辑 | w1_cf_fallback_docred, w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-15 | D024: W5 composability 确认——Fine-tuned + OntoCoDec  | w5_lora_scierc_constrained_eval, w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval, w5_lora_scierc_training, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-15 | D024: W5 composability 确认 — Fine-tuned + OntoCoDec | w5_lora_scierc_constrained_eval, w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval, w5_lora_scierc_training, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-15 | Reframe Claim 3 (composability): 从 \\\\\\\"fine-tuning 后仍 | w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-15 | D022: W5 gate DR=1.95%≈2%, 仍跑 constrained eval 收集完 | w5_lora_scierc_unconstrained_eval, w5_lora_scierc_training |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-15 | D021: 保留 w1_cf_fallback_docred 实验（修正 D020），取消仅限 2  | w1_cf_fallback_docred, w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-15 | D020: W1 CF fallback 定为 analytical finding（方案 A 变体 | w1_cf_fallback_scierc_pilot, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4203, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011JtavGK3Vw1qHMRn8LoSAf","session_id":"a8f7b9b0-e3ba-485f-a37e-4e472b218b82","uuid":"5be9b6fa-f469-44a6-b746-e9e3f9f3879a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:52:41.689Z"}
