{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WyRmTg1jvFpDXD2tcVrmYT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema_semantic_constrained_ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (40 个)\\n\\n- **llama_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_full_s2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_grammar_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **phase2_s2_pilot50**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_scierc_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| w5_qwen_docred_lora_constrained_eval | Fine-tuned Qwen3-8B DocRED LoRA + OntoCoDec constrained eval — 验证 composability：约束解码在 fine-tuned Qwen DocRED 上是否仍能消除残余 DR 且不损 R-F1 | — | — | — |\\n| w5_llama_docred_lora_constrained_eval | Fine-tuned Llama-3.1-8B DocRED LoRA + OntoCoDec constrained eval — 验证 composability：约束解码在 fine-tuned Llama DocRED 上是否仍能消除残余 DR 且不损 R-F1 | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_scierc（准备中）\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_docred（准备中）\\n- w5_llama_docred_sft_data_gen: Generate Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct format DocRED SFT train/dev JSONL — prerequisite for Llama DocRED LoRA fine-tune (composability matrix Llama×DocRED cell)（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **w5_qwen_docred_lora_unconstrained_eval** (success): Fine-tuned Qwen3-8B DocRED LoRA unconstrained eval — 获取 fine-tuned baseline DR/R-F1，与 constrained eval 对比计算 composability delta ← 基于 w5_qwen_docred_lora_training\\n- **w5_llama_docred_lora_unconstrained_eval** (success): Fine-tuned Llama-3.1-8B DocRED LoRA unconstrained eval — 获取 fine-tuned baseline DR/R-F1，与 constrained eval 对比计算 composability delta ← 基于 w5_llama_docred_lora_training\\n- **w5_qwen_docred_lora_training** (success): Qwen3-8B LoRA fine-tune on DocRED — 填补 Qwen DocRED composability 2×2 matrix 的 FT 行。预期：(1) LoRA 后 E-F1/R-F1 大幅提升；(2) 残余 DR > 0% 证明 OntoCoDec 在 DocRED FT 上仍有 composability 价值。\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 32 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 35\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w1_cf_fallback_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HtRXuiYSA4cqSMkc9Ax1p4","session_id":"a8f7b9b0-e3ba-485f-a37e-4e472b218b82","uuid":"90656c9a-05bd-4e3f-86c5-70d0c5c863d6","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:53:01.897Z"}
